{
  "schema": "execution-conformance-v1",
  "name": "restart-unknown-reconciled-not-sent",
  "description": "A complete reconcile without the idempotency key proves the unknown submit never reached the broker: the level asks the user (never auto-resent); 送出 uses a NEW key.",
